  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{m}}=1000 \\times \\frac{\\mathrm{K}}{\\mathrm{M}}$<br />$=1000 \\times \\frac{2 \\times 10^{-5}}{0.001}=20 \\mathrm{~S} \\mathrm{~cm}^2 \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$<br />$\\Rightarrow \\alpha=\\frac{\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{m}}}{\\Lambda_{\\mathrm{m}}^{\\circ}}=\\frac{20}{190}=\\left(\\frac{2}{19}\\right)$<br />$\\underset{0.001(1-\\alpha)}{\\mathrm{HA}} \\rightleftharpoons \\underset{0.001 \\alpha}{\\mathrm{H}^{+}}+\\underset{0.001 \\alpha}{\\mathrm{A}^{-}}$<br />$K_{\\mathrm{a}}=0.001\\left(\\frac{\\alpha^2}{1-\\alpha}\\right)=\\frac{0.001 \\times\\left(\\frac{2}{19}\\right)^2}{1-\\left(\\frac{2}{19}\\right)}$<br />$=12.3 \\times 10^{-6}$",
    "image": null
  },
